                        {
                            "id": "700480105",
                            "text": "Those are Koholasaurs.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "700480109",
                                    "speaker": "Freminet",
                                    "text": "Natlan's ecology is so different from Fontaine's, it's truly something special. If only everyone from the \"House\" could come here to see it..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700480110",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "You could always show them pictures of the resort. I'll help."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700480111",
                                    "speaker": "Freminet",
                                    "text": "Pictures? That's a wonderful idea! That way, I can record the scenery so I never forget."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700480112",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "And we'll get a picture of you while we're at it."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700480113",
                                    "speaker": "Freminet",
                                    "text": "A picture of... me? Really?"
                                },
